      <p class="story-en">This past year was a really <b>hard time</b> for us. We got hurt in practice, and there were many days nothing went our way. Today is finally the last rehearsal before the <b>comeback stage</b>. <b>Hajun</b> says with a smile, "Practice is <b>far from hard</b> — it's actually more fun!" Then he adds, "I get <b>nervous</b> in front of the stage, <b>whereas</b> Yuna is always calm." <b>Jiwoo</b> says quietly, "<b>Even though</b> it was so <b>hard</b>, we've come this far. Even so, I'll keep going." <b>Seoyeon</b> nods with energy. "Right. <b>Far from giving up</b>, we've become stronger now. Let's make the best stage together!" 💙</p>
